<title>USA: New Holland may get Flexi-Coil stake.</title>
<headline>New Holland may get Flexi-Coil stake.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Holland NV, a Netherlands-based agricultural and construction equipment firm, said on Tuesday that it entered a tentative deal that may lead to the company acquiring a stake in Flexi-Coil, a leader in air seeder technology.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed, but a transaction is expected to be completed during the fourth quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Privately held Flexi-Coil is Canada's largest farm implement manufacturer.</p>
</text>
